        <mxCell id="gr" value='&lt;b&gt;Loop guardrails (shared Principle VII)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Depth two: manager → specialists → tools; tools hold no model&lt;br&gt;2. Finite search: catalog in the semantic layer; no rerun with the same parameters&lt;br&gt;3. Caps as backstop: rounds, stalls, tool calls, wall time, tokens&lt;br&gt;4. Defined exit: "unresolved, investigate next"; output never blocked&lt;br&gt;5. Numbers belong to code' style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1170" y="910" width="315" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
